Hey everyone,

We're super grateful for all the feedback and reports we've been getting since releasing the Demo yesterday.

Here are some quick fixes that we have just deployed for Update #1:

Fixes
🔨 Fixed Trinkets and Blessed Gear sometimes not picking the best one to equip automatically;
🔨 Fixed a case where a skill kept being executed without a button press;
🔨 Fixed Double Knives not working with "Should Walk To Skill Range" option;
🔨 Fixed the Hub background music and ambience playing together during the Great Bell cutscene;
🔨 Fixed the description of the Maximum Level skill tree node;
🔨 Fixed some Blessings descriptions not showing correctly after interacting with Foundation Blessings;
🔨 The tooltip of skills not yet available should now be hidden (you weren't suppose to know about them yet, spoilers!!!);
🔨 Fixed Protection Shrine status having an incorrect description (it does NOT grant invulnerability, just increases resistances);


Changes
🎨 Updated the Maximum Skill Level skill tree node icon to something more suitable;
🎨 Updated the Scout's Medal relic icon with a non-placeholder visual;
🎨 The default quality setting now is Ultra instead of Low;

Thanks again for playing and providing us with great feedback - please keep it coming, we want to build this game together with the community, and this is barely just the start!

Cheers!
~The Hell Clock Team
